Subject: [PATCH] share: track mapped ranges and compare outer bytes

Enabled by the share-coherent guest with virtiofs.mmap_poll=1 (stat) or 2
(content). Poll interval is 2 ms after each scan. Content snapshots are bounded
to 64 MiB, tracked conservatively until RELEASE, and shared across handles.
The root-only fault ioctl requires the negotiated recovery feature.

